WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Your business. One workspace. A guided look at KeeperBMA’s interactive demo. Explore freely. Fictional data resets on refresh.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Sign in. Ring up a sale. Choose a demo cashier, add products and select a saved customer or walk-in. Step 3 · Staff sign-in is a simulation, not secure authentication

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Keep the sale connected. The sample receipt records the cashier, customer, total and earned points. Jason · $25.00 sample sale · 25 points earned

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Plan your team by branch. Assign Jason and Kay to Monday’s 9 AM–2 PM shift and review planned hours. Step 4 · Scheduling does not clock staff in

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Bring customers back with points. Optional phone membership, purchase history and owner-adjustable rewards. 100 points = $1 by default · Phone verification and SMS are not connected

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
See the numbers together. Review sales, discounts, product costs, expenses and tax collected. Accounting overview only · Not complete bookkeeping or tax filing

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Try it yourself. No signup needed. Explore the demo and tell us what would help your work. www.keeperbma.com/demo.html
